^(?<prefix_i><line-height=90%>)?(?<first>(?:By\ turning\ Lady\ Brit\ in\ to\ Bernardo,\ I\ managed\ to\ stop\ her\ from\ killing\ me\ this\ loop\.\ It\ seems\ my\ success\ might\ be\ permanent—I\ was\ surprised\ by\ a\ visit\ from\ Quince,\ who\ promised\ me\ Brit\ would\ never\ come\ after\ my\ life\ again\.\ How\ he\ intends\ to\ accomplish\ this,\ I'm\ unsure,\ but\ for\ now—I\ wonder\ what\ else\ lies\ before\ me\.|Brit\ seems\ convinced\ that\ it\ is\ Claudius\ having\ me\ killed,\ because\ he\ finds\ my\ affection\ for\ Hamlet\ dangerous\.\ It's\ believable,\ almost\.\.\.\ but\ if\ Claudius\ wanted\ me\ dead,\ he's\ killed\ before,\ and\ wouldn't\ send\ another\ to\ do\ that\ work\.\ Still,\ maybe\ there\ is\ something\ to\ find\ there\.|My\ efforts\ paid\ off\.\ The\ spy,\ and\ my\ repeated\ killer,\ is\ Lady\ Brit\.\ She's\ been\ in\ Norway's\ graces\ all\ along\.\ I've\ got\ to\ find\ a\ way\ to\ expose\ her\ before\ she\ slits\ my\ throat\ again\.\ Now\ I\ just\ have\ to\ stop\ her\.|I\ can\ convince\ Laertes\ to\ stay\ if\ I\ tell\ him\ of\ my\ fears\ before\ he\ leaves\.\ I'm\ not\ sure\ what\ will\ come\ of\ it,\ but\ my\ brother\ is\ determined\ to\ unravel\ the\ potential\ threat\.\ I\ should\ follow\ him\.|Bernardo\ is\ running\ his\ own\ investigation,\ interviewing\ people\ about\ what\ they\ know\.\ If\ I\ send\ people\ to\ him,\ perhaps\ I\ could\ learn\ something\ by\ observing\ the\ meetings\ he\ has\ with\ them\.|Lady\ Brit\ is\ apprehended,\ locked\ away\ in\ a\ cell\ by\ Bernardo\.\ Does\ this\ mean\ I've\ successfully\ prevented\ my\ death\?\ If\ I\ make\ it\ to\ Saturday\ night,\ I'll\ know\ I\ have\.|There\ is\ a\ spy\ in\ Elsinore\ Castle,\ and\ I\ have\ to\ find\ out\ who\ it\ is\.\ If\ I\ cannot,\ then\ come\ Saturday\ morning,\ I\ die\.\ But\ where\ would\ I\ start\?\ Who\ could\ help\ me\?|Bernardo\ suspects\ that\ there\ is\ a\ spy\ in\ Elsinore\ castle,\ stealing\ sensitive\ information\ and\ passing\ it\ on\ to\ unknown\ forces\.\