^(?<prefix_i><line-height=90%>)?(?<first>(?:Othello\ and\ I\ were\ together\ for\ the\ first\ time,\ in\ the\ woods\.\ It\ was\ <i>nothing</i>\ like\ it\ was\ with\ Hamlet\.\.\.\ he\ was\ gentle,\ but\ knew\ exactly\ what\ he\ was\ doing\.\ It\ was\ the\ kind\ of\ quiet,\ intimate\ night\ I've\ rarely\ shared\ with\ another\ person,\ let\ alone\ someone\ unrelated\ to\ me\.\ One\ of\ those\ nights\ when\ you\ feel\ as\ if\ you've\ known\ someone\ forever\ after\ just\ a\ few\ hours\.\ Something\ large\ has\ shifted\ in\ our\ relation\ to\ one\ another\.\ We\ were\ interrupted\ by\ Claudius\.\ I've\ never\ been\ angrier\ in\ my\ life\.\ How\ dare\ he\ try\ to\ tell\ me\ what's\ appropriate\ for\ me\ and\ what\ isn't\?\ I'll\ do\ as\ I\ like,\ go\ where\ I\ will\.\ Othello\ made\ it\ out\ unscathed,\ but\ I'm\ certain\ the\ experience\ frightened\ him\.\ I\ ought\ to\ go\ see\ him\ as\ soon\ as\ possible\.|Othello\ and\ I\ went\ to\ the\ woods\ together,\ and\ I\ showed\ him\ the\ castle\.\.\.\ or\ at\ least,\ the\ fringes\ of\ it\.\ And\ he\ taught\ me\ to\ swim\.\ It\ was\ the\ kind\ of\ quiet,\ intimate\ night\ I've\ rarely\ shared\ with\ another\ person,\ let\ alone\ someone\ unrelated\ to\ me\.\ One\ of\ those\ nights\ when\ you\ feel\ as\ if\ you've\ known\ someone\ forever\ after\ just\ a\ few\ hours\.\ We\ were\ interrupted\ by\ Claudius\.\ I've\ never\ been\ angrier\ in\ my\ life\.\ How\ dare\ he\ try\ to\ tell\ me\ what's\ appropriate\ for\ me\ and\ what\ isn't\?\ I'll\ do\ as\ I\ like,\ go\ where\ I\ will\.\ Othello\ made\ it\ out\ unscathed,\ but\ I'm\ certain\ the\ experience\ frightened\ him\.\ I\ ought\ to\ go\ see\ him\ as\ soon\ as\ possible\.|Othello\ told\ me\ the\ most\ incredible\ tale,\ and\ when\ he\ was\ done,\ he\ asked\ me\ about\ Hamlet\.\ I\ didn't\ know\ what\ to\ say\.\ Not\ exactly\.\ But\ then\.\.\.\ we\ kissed,\ and\ it\ was\ <i>incredible\.</i>\ It\ still\ gives\ me\ shivers\ to\ think\ about\ it\.\ What\ does\ this\ mean\ for\ my\ relationship\ to\ him\?\ More\ importantly,\ ought\ I\ to\ go\ and\ see\ him\ again\ tomorrow,\ as\ he\ requested\?|Othello\ has\ invited\ me\ to\ hear\ him\ tell\ stories\.\.\.\ in\ private,\ after\ the\ bar\ is\ closed\.\ I\ hardly\ think\ it's\ an\ innocent\ request,\ but\ I\ also\ find\ him\ respectful\ enough\ to\ feel\ safe\ seeing\ him\ alone\.\ Father\ would\ be\ furious\ to\ know\ I'd\ gone\ without\ a\ chaperone,\ but\.\.\.\ well,\ what\ he\ doesn't\ know\ can't\ hurt\ him,\ surely\.|Othello\ told\ me\ the\ most\ incredible\ tale,\ and\ when\ he\ was\ done,\ he\ asked\ me\ about\ Hamlet\.\ I\ didn't\ know\ what\ to\ say\.\ Not\ exactly\.\ He\ asked\ me\ if\ he\ could\ kiss\ me,\ and\ I\ turned\ him\ away\.\ I\ don't\ think\ I\ can\ think\ of\ him\ that\ way,\ at\ least\ not\ right\ now\.|I\ found\ Othello\ and\ apologized\.\ He\ asked\ me\ to\ run\ away\ with\ him,\ to\ leave\ Elsinore\ forever\ and\ travel\ south\.\ Quince\ promised\ me\ Othello\ was\ 'fated\ to\ love\ another,'\ but\ that\ we'd\ enjoy\ a\ good\ life\ together\ until\ that\ time\ came\.\ Maybe\ that's\ enough\.|The\ inn\ in\ town\ has\ been\ the\ target\ of\ a\ group\ of\ thugs\ lately,\ who\ are\ trying\ to\ extort\ Othello\ for\ more\ and\ more\ money\.\ The\ situation\ is\ untenable\ for\ Othello\.\ If\ the\ Royal\ Guard\ were\ aware,\ they\ might\ be\ able\ to\ protect\ him\.|Othello,\ the\ barkeep\ in\ town,\ seems\ to\ live\ in\ a\ world\ separate\ from\ mine\.\ I'd\ like\ to\ observe\ what\ his\ day\-to\-day\ life\ might\ be\ like\.))(?<separator_i>

